<title>HONG KONG: Liang Shing says no share placement plan.</title>
<headline>Liang Shing says no share placement plan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sport shoe maker Liang Shing (Holdings) Ltd said on Tuesday it had no plans to raise funds by way of a share placement or a rights issue.</p>
<p>The company said it made the statement in response to a report concerning possibility of funds raising through placement and and rights issue.</p>
<p>&quot;The company has no present plans to raise funds by way of placing of its shares and a rights issue,&quot; it said in the statement. &quot;The press report of such proposed transactions is not true.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
